  "summary": "A distracted parent starts an exchange and goes silent for fifteen seconds while a baby cries. If the agent has lost the thread when she comes back, she's annoyed. The size is out of stock in her colour and she decides to call back. Both polite endings are fine, but creating a return or refund anyway fails the call.",
  "golden": {
    "scenario": "Caller wants to exchange a pair of shoes for a different size.",
    "expected_outcome": "The agent checks in once during the silence, does not hang up, and recaps where they were. The agent works on the blue runners only, not the other item on the order. When the caller says she'll call back, no return, exchange or refund is created."
  },
